<p>President Trump said Russia and Ukraine agreed to a U.S.-requested three-day ceasefire from May 9 through May 11, with all “kinetic activity” suspended and each side exchanging 1,000 prisoners of war. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and Russian presidential foreign affairs adviser Yuri Ushakov confirmed the arrangement, according to NPR; The Guardian and DW also reported confirmation from both sides. The dates coincide with Russia’s Victory Day commemorations of the Soviet victory over Nazi Germany in World War II, a holiday observed on May 9. Earlier pauses in fighting this week broke down after Moscow and Kyiv accused each other of violations. Trump later said he wanted the temporary truce extended beyond the three days.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/_uVPqDCpTzyfsXVDCoFQ1152oxn-hsPJwOv8TOZARx8ta9ZMzhiUmNlD05eH1ERBq0Fhb86v-gLQixEcDyqcPjW7LC6k-NVEqtWT1iKWtfxIe2bDWrywNnD2xWo2X43Y3PdIMIDrD34m4W2C5HbEISicds21XmaDQCtEKipN9VS5tUbcEq69F-v5yoSlATmZMHnsLF_B9ngia5zDNX77RqaMbjXlzVl6c5NITa_n0LFbWzGBWzUgoXU2USXbI4Ia4-9oPM8eUT6MuDvUlKNoRsBLGknF' alt='Ukraine troops undertake military skills at a training ground near the front line.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Prior proposals: Channels Television reported that Ukraine had earlier said it offered a truce that Moscow ignored before the U.S.-announced pause.</li><li>Drone claims: Times of India reported that Russia said it intercepted numerous drones around the time of the truce announcement.</li><li>Negotiating pressure: Aaj reported that Trump had grown increasingly frustrated by the lack of progress in ending the Ukraine-Russia war.</li></ul><blockquote>We expect the United States to ensure that the Russian side fulfills these agreements. - Volodymyr Zelenskyy</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: Trump said talks to end the war were continuing and that the sides were “getting closer and closer every day.” (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3352962/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine'>SCMP</a>)</li><li>Ukrainian government: Zelenskyy said the arrangement reflected U.S. diplomatic involvement and signaled Kyiv’s support. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/05/08/russia-ukraine-war-trump-ceasefire-00912463'>Politico</a>)</li><li>Russian government: Yury Ushakov, Putin’s foreign affairs aide, said Moscow’s participation would extend Russia’s own May 8-9 ceasefire into the U.S.-announced window. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/639696-trump-russia-ukraine-ceasefire/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Financial Times: The newspaper said doubts remained about whether Putin would commit to a more durable settlement beyond a temporary halt in fighting. (<a href='https://www.ft.com/content/7e9cb5d9-277e-43ba-9ba1-5f45f3bef7f9'>Financial Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3352962/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine'>Trump announces 3-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/8/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war'>Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/7e9cb5d9-277e-43ba-9ba1-5f45f3bef7f9'>Trump says Russia and Ukraine agree 3-day ceasefire and prisoner swap</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-and-prisoner-exchange/'>Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire and prisoner exchange</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-his-request-for-a-3-day-ceasefire-and-a-prisoner-swap'>Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for 3-day ceasefire and prisoner swap</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/trump-hopes-for-extension-to-three-d